ROOM YARD A COBBLED YARD BEFORE AN OLD WATERMILL. A RIVER RUNS PAST, AND A SHED STANDS TO THE EAST.
ROOM SHED A WOODEN SHED THAT SMELLS OF TAR.
ROOM MILL THE MILL FLOOR. THE GREAT WHEEL IS STILL. A LADDER GOES UP AND STONE STEPS GO DOWN.
ROOM LOFT A DUSTY LOFT UNDER THE ROOF.
ROOM CELLAR A DAMP CELLAR WHERE WATER DRIPS FROM THE CEILING.
EXIT YARD N MILL
EXIT MILL S YARD
EXIT YARD E SHED
EXIT SHED W YARD
EXIT MILL U LOFT
EXIT LOFT D MILL
EXIT MILL D CELLAR
EXIT CELLAR U MILL
FIX RIVER YARD A FAST RIVER.
OBJ LAMP SHED AN OIL LAMP.
OBJ MATCHES SHED A BOX OF MATCHES.
OBJ KEY CELLAR AN IRON KEY.
FIX CHEST LOFT AN OAK CHEST WITH A LOCK.
OBJ SILVER NOWHERE A BAG OF SILVER.
ON LIGHT LAMP IF HAVE LAMP AND HAVE MATCHES AND NOT LIT THEN SAY THE LAMP BURNS BRIGHTLY.; SET LIT; SCORE 5
ON LIGHT LAMP THEN SAY YOU CAN'T.
ON D IF AT MILL AND NOT HAVE LAMP THEN SAY IT IS TOO DARK TO GO DOWN THERE.
ON D IF AT MILL AND NOT LIT THEN SAY IT IS TOO DARK TO GO DOWN THERE.
ON OPEN CHEST IF HAVE KEY AND HERE CHEST AND NOT OPENED THEN SAY THE LID CREAKS UP. INSIDE IS SILVER.; MOVE SILVER LOFT; SET OPENED; SCORE 20
ON OPEN CHEST IF HERE CHEST THEN SAY IT WON'T OPEN.
ON SWIM RIVER IF AT YARD THEN SAY THE CURRENT SWEEPS YOU AWAY.; DIE
ON DROP SILVER IF HAVE SILVER AND AT YARD THEN SAY YOU ARE RICH! THE MILL CAN TURN AGAIN.; SCORE 20; WIN
